msgid "Up to %s can be refunded. Leave at the maximum for a full refund (releases tickets and capacity)."
msgstr "Op til %s kan refunderes. Lad stå på maksimum for fuld refundering (frigiver billetter og kapacitet)."

msgid "Vis — Ticket settings"
msgstr "Vis — Billetindstillinger"

msgid "We are confirming your payment for order %s. Your tickets will be emailed to you shortly."
msgstr "Vi bekræfter din betaling for ordre %s. Dine billetter sendes til dig via e-mail om et øjeblik."

msgid "We could not find your order, but if your payment went through your tickets are on their way by email."
msgstr "Vi kunne ikke finde din ordre, men hvis din betaling gik igennem, er dine billetter på vej via e-mail."

msgid "Webhook endpoint"
msgstr "Webhook-endpoint"

msgid "Webhook signing secret"
msgstr "Webhook-signeringsnøgle"

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "Arbejder…"

msgid "You can buy at most %d entrance tickets."
msgstr "Du kan højst købe %d adgangsbilletter."

msgid "Your details"
msgstr "Dine oplysninger"

msgid "Your order %s is confirmed. Your tickets have been sent to your email address."
msgstr "Din ordre %s er bekræftet. Dine billetter er sendt til din e-mailadresse."

msgid "Your payment was cancelled or did not go through, so no tickets were issued and you have not been charged."
msgstr "Din betaling blev annulleret eller gik ikke igennem, så der blev ikke udstedt billetter, og du er ikke blevet opkrævet."

msgid "Your session expired. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "Din session udløb. Genindlæs siden, og prøv igen."

msgid "Your tickets for %s"
msgstr "Dine billetter til %s"

msgid "Your tickets will be emailed to this address."
msgstr "Dine billetter sendes til denne e-mailadresse."

msgid "your event"
msgstr "din begivenhed"

msgid "“%s” is sold out or not on sale."
msgstr "“%s” er udsolgt eller ikke til salg."

