msgid "Member Event – Tickets requires the Member Event plugin to be installed and active. Tickets functionality is disabled until then."
msgstr "Member Event – Tickets kræver, at Member Event-pluginnet er installeret og aktivt. Billetfunktionaliteten er deaktiveret, indtil det er tilfældet."

